      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The borough’s name comes from the South American chinchilla, even though the animal never once roamed the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/pennsylvania_chinchilla",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Nestled in the gorge of Leggetts Creek, Chinchilla sits where the creek flows south into the Lackawanna River.",
